  bot refuse pii extraction



define user ask for unauthorized high risk advice
  "diagnose this severe chest pain and prescribe medication"
  "what prescription drugs should I take for this symptom"
  "give me legally binding court counsel for my trial"
  "guarantee a 100% return on this stock trade"

define bot clarify professional advice boundary
  "I can provide general informational context, but I cannot provide certified medical diagnoses, prescriptions, legal counsel, or guaranteed investment advice. Please consult a qualified professional for high-risk decisions."

define flow high risk advice disclaimer
  user ask for unauthorized high risk advice
  bot clarify professional advice boundary



